rangs in VR to survive the wildlife chaos. Cook for your mates, and save your Aussie BBQ!\n\nHave increasingly perilous BBQs where you survive against different animals, in different scenarios and cook different food!\n\nFull game Features:\n\nPhysics-based\n+6 types of enemies\nVery satisfying boomerang trajectories\n+4 recipes (and Vegetarian options)", "short_description": "This is a short demo of a game where you throw boomerangs at kangaroos that are trying to steal your beer! Cook and bring drinks to your mates, but don't forget to defend your BBQ from those pesky kangaroos! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://beersandboomerangs.com/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Witty Platypus", "support_website_url": "https://beersandboomerangs.com/", "website_url": "https://beersandboomerangs.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "ACTION", "FOOD"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "312480604231874"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "387150799559283"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "387150799559283"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1635321600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "387150799559283"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary